# Render scratch: frame grid, captured audio, narration, timing log.
video/
trim.json
framescan/
# Review stills written by `node director.mjs shots`.
beat_*.png

# youtube/posted.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It was, back when this ran in
# one long-lived container and the file could just stay on disk. A scheduled
# workflow gets a clean runner every time, so an untracked file is an empty one:
# the picker would find no history, fall back to the first cut, and post the same
# one every day. It is committed for the same reason it exists.
